domain ADR0059:
  description "Proposed revision1: complete focused character final-review payload, shared accounting and immutable draft correction. No owner acceptance recorded."
problem P1:
  "Complete character create/correction/confirmation while preserving profile claim validation, owner-fenced final storage and all test files. Current HTTP suite passes13 and fails2."
evidence USER_GOAL:
  "Owner requests sealing correctly traced tests and making every original test pass. This goal does not independently accept a changed numeric policy, closed proposal union or draft source command."
evidence CURRENT:
  "Current source snapshot and successful CLI causal audit are docs/evidence/character-create-boundary-rca-source-snapshot-2026-10-07.json and character-create-boundary-rca-2026-10-07-audit.txt. Semantic definition readiness is persisted as owner-ready without a complete profile envelope; create review calls a migrate-only reader; draft chat has no correction branch. The offline create fixture consumes8 semantic calls. No provider execution was performed."
evidence AUTHORITY:
  "Accepted ADR0011 structure-before-public-profile/support-validation, ADR0030 D10 immutable new semantic result and D11 exact activation, retained by ADR0031 and accepted foundation revision3, govern this repair. Accepted character requirements revision5 R16/R18/R21 require full validation, complete final review and one shared budget. Accepted kernel implementation design section4 defines a closed proposal union; section7.1 uses max8 calls; section9 has owner-answer/retry commands but no candidate correction command."
premise OPTIONS:
  "Option1 complete profile work inside one run, max10 character create/revise calls, unchanged cumulative tokens/USD0.50 cap. Option2 keep8 and separately redesign semantic work to reserve2 profile calls without losing lenses; feasibility not proved. Separate profile budget after terminal violates inherited one-attempt limits. Definition-only activation or rejection-only correction tests do not fulfill the goal."
decision D1_HANDOFF based_on P1, CURRENT, AUTHORITY:
  "Propose a mode-discriminated family-ready type. Create/revise readiness requires strict CharacterGenerationEnvelopeV3 plus definition/profile/claim-validation receipts. Migrate retains existing migration candidate rules. Semantic definition completion stays internal until full envelope validation. Producer, final saver and acceptance consumer require the type; optional candidates or assertions cannot supply a missing contract. External/DB/LLM values decode strictly. Generic kernel and HTTP routes do not own profile semantics."
decision D2_PROFILE_WORK based_on D1_HANDOFF, AUTHORITY:
  "Propose registered profile-generation and profile-claim-review work before terminal, after whole server structural validation. A dedicated family module owns typed public-source projection, generation and result validation. Generation sees frozen publicly eligible relevant source fragments plus V3-to-CharacterProfileSourceProjectionV2 facts, never complete V3 candidate/schema or restricted preservation. Validator sees display projection and generated profile only. Verify segments/support refs; unsupported material facts block readiness. A generation response's self-reported supported verdict is not the independent validator. Both calls use existing reservation/send/settlement and owner fence in the same run. Failure, budget exhaustion or fence loss prevents final ready/notification; no extra sends after terminal. Received late usage settles under existing rules."
decision D3_SHARED_POLICY based_on D2_PROFILE_WORK, OPTIONS, AUTHORITY:
  "Propose versioned max10 physical LLM calls for new character create/revise runs, including scope resolution, semantics, repair, profile, claim validation and authorized resends. Migrate/battlefield/narration-style policies and all existing frozen run policies retain8. Keep maxConcurrentProviderRequests1, maxCountedSteps48, per-call input6000 tokens/24576 bytes, output1500 tokens/6144 bytes, cumulative input32000 tokens/output8000 tokens, maxCostMicroUsd500000, progress observations8 and recovery strategy changes2. Preserve pricing/token-estimator/transport controls. Ten is an upper bound, not success guarantee; whichever cap expires first stops work. This proposal grants no live paid dispatch, release, deploy or production DB mutation."
decision D4_DRAFT_CORRECTION based_on D1_HANDOFF, AUTHORITY:
  "Propose existing POST character-drafts/:id/chat accepting message plus required Idempotency-Key. Digest binds owner, predecessor attempt, predecessor candidate digest and requested instruction; exact replay returns the same new attempt, different reuse rejects. Add a typed frozen review-candidate source variant, not a fabricated active generation. Validate owner, latest predecessor, full semantic candidate/digest/receipts and current pointer. For unactivated creation retain original character identity and null expected generation; active generation revisions use existing revision command. New attempt preserves old result and performs scope resolution, affected repairs, full validation and new profile work. Return existing accepted DTO new attemptId plus predecessorAttemptId. Explicit separate confirmation binds new final candidate digest; original attempt is not edited."
decision D5_STORAGE_OLD_RESULTS based_on D1_HANDOFF, D2_PROFILE_WORK, D4_DRAFT_CORRECTION, AUTHORITY:
  "Propose atomic owner-fenced family final envelope/digest, run terminal result, family status, unique attempt/kind notification and job completion. No partial ready payload. GET only projects; confirm performs exact candidate/receipt/CAS checks with zero provider work. Pre-repair semantic-only ready records remain readable but unacceptably incomplete with explicit reason; never automatically dispatch or activate. An explicit owner correction may reference a validated old semantic candidate as new frozen source; missing/corrupt data rejects without guessing. Existing migrate candidates/completed generations are unchanged. Reuse existing final storage; if new columns prove necessary, present exact DDL separately. Update chat clients/tests for required idempotency and returned successor identity."
decision D6_VERIFY_LIMITS based_on P1, D1_HANDOFF, D2_PROFILE_WORK, D3_SHARED_POLICY, D4_DRAFT_CORRECTION, D5_STORAGE_OLD_RESULTS:
  "Proposed verification: all15 original HTTP cases succeed with correction/new-history/exact-confirm coverage; missing-envelope/profile/claim receipts rejected by compile contract or strict entrance schema; whole-run calls/caps/fence/late/terminal send behavior; unsupported claims and digest mismatch block saving/activation/notice; replay/drift/owner isolation/GET purity/migration retention. Preserve247 unit files plus4 E2E and unsealed hard stop. Full typecheck and formal tests required. Offline mocks do not prove live model quality, real latency or universal completion. Historical cause and detection escape remain unknown."
decision OWNER_REVIEW_PENDING based_on USER_GOAL, OPTIONS, D1_HANDOFF, D2_PROFILE_WORK, D3_SHARED_POLICY, D4_DRAFT_CORRECTION, D5_STORAGE_OLD_RESULTS, D6_VERIFY_LIMITS:
  "Revision1 is Proposed. Ask owner whether to accept this exact typed completion/correction contract and max10 calls with unchanged cumulative token/cost caps, or keep8 and first redesign semantic scheduling. Call allowance rises25percent; actual tokens/cost/latency unknown. No accepted detailed-design rewrite, implementation or policy mutation occurs before explicit acceptance. Paid tests/deploy and old discarded trial are outside scope."
premise HISTORICAL_OWNER_ACCEPTANCE_PENDING:
  "Product owner must accept, revise or reject exact ADR0059 revision1. Max10 calls, complete ready envelope, closed profile-work extension and immutable candidate-correction source/command remain proposals."

evidence OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  "2026-10-08 product owner explicitly states キャラ作成は推奨通り after Japanese explanation of ADR0059 complete same-run final envelope, max10 calls with unchanged cost/tokens and immutable successor attempt. Paid/live and deployment remain outside scope."
decision ACCEPTANCE based_on OWNER_ACCEPTANCE, D1_HANDOFF, D2_PROFILE_WORK, D3_SHARED_POLICY, D4_DRAFT_CORRECTION, D5_STORAGE_OLD_RESULTS, D6_VERIFY_LIMITS:
  "Accept revision1 D1-D6. Earlier proposed/pending statements are the historical proposal, superseded for decision status by this explicit owner acceptance. Implement full success behavior and preserve all original test files; no paid/live/deploy authority."
